DTEND;TZID=America/Los_Angeles:20261023T200000
UID:2f895a63388ecc6e66d58ab210c39b5710202026_12:38:05_AM@campusgroups.com
DESCRIPTION:Currency Wars – Random Challenge!\nAre you confident in your
  strategies and team-building skills in Honkai: Star Rail? Come and challe
 nge yourself in the Currency Wars – Random Challenge!\nDuring the compet
 ition\, participants will randomly draw special rules that restrict charac
 ter selection\, equipment\, and battle strategies. Players must adjust the
 ir teams and overcome these unexpected challenges to achieve victory!\nThe
  event also features Team Composition Rules and Fun Punishment Challenges\
 , adding more excitement and surprises! After defeating each major boss\, 
 participants must complete a new fun challenge\, such as singing\, imitati
 ng characters\, or performing funny actions.\nThe player who completes the
  challenge in the shortest time while following all the rules wins!\nAre y
 ou ready to test your luck\, creativity\, and strategy? Join us and become
  the ultimate Currency Wars Master!
LOCATION:Walker Hall\, Room 1330\, 1 Shields Ave\, Davis\, California 9561
 6\, United States
URL:https://aggielife.ucdavis.edu/rsvp?id=909801
X-SOURCE:UC Davis CampusGroups
