SUMMARY:National Make a Difference Day Tree Planting at LAMRC
DESCRIPTION:Join CAL FIRE staff\, affiliated organizations\, and neighborhood residents and leaders as the Lewis A. Moran Reforestation Center (LAMRC) continues its green transformation and celebrates the site’s 105th anniversary! \nWith support from West Coast Arborists\, Tree Davis\, and a volunteer Tree Advisory Group\, we hope to welcome your help in reforesting the Reforestation Center with a palette of primarily climate-adapted trees for the Sacramento Valley. This event is being held on Saturday\, October 24th from 9am-noon as part of National Make a Difference Day. Hear guest speakers detail the project and its trees\, acknowledge the history of the site\, and recognize the grander importance of making a difference in our community with future resilience in mind. Afterward\, a tree-planting demonstration will be given before volunteers can assist with installing 15-gallon-sized specimens along the property’s perimeter. Several booths and information will be available as will light refreshments. Tools will be provided\, but feel free to bring a pair of gloves to lend a hand! \nThe Reforestation Center is located at 5800 Chiles Road\, Davis\, CA 95618. For questions\, please reach out to reforestation@fire.ca.gov \nTo register\, please sign up directly at www.tinyurl.com/49byapkm. A waiver will be sent directly to you following registration.
URL:https://thedirt.online/event/national-make-a-difference-day-tree-planting-at-lamrc/
LOCATION:5800 Chiles Road\, Davis\, CA 95618\, 5800 Chiles Road\, Davis\, 95618\, United States
CATEGORIES:Community
ATTACH;FMTTYPE=image/png:https://thedirt.online/wp-content/uploads/2026/09/Oct24_NMADD_Flyer.png
ORGANIZER;CN="Tree Davis":MAILTO:erin@treedavis.org
END:VEVENT
