BEGIN:VEVENT
X-SOURCE-URLS:{"Davis Downtown": "https://davisdowntown.com/event/day-in-downtown-2/"}
X-SOURCE-ID:davis_downtown
SUMMARY:Day in Downtown
DTSTART;TZID=America/Los_Angeles:20261025T030000
DTEND;TZID=America/Los_Angeles:20261025T090000
UID:10002110-1792922400-1792944000@davisdowntown.com
DESCRIPTION:Spend a full day exploring Day in Downtown – a vibrant\, f
 ree street event bringing together local talent and community! From 10 AM 
 to 4 PM\, browse a diverse lineup of vendors on E Street (between 3rd & 4t
 h St.)\, including: \n\nVintage clothing & unique finds\nLocal artists\, m
 akers\, and creators\nDavis brick-and-mortar shops\nNon-profits sharing th
 eir work\nMusic by DRC\nSpecial spots like Sophia’s Thai Kitchen for tas
 ty bites\n\nDiscover one-of-a-kind items\, support small businesses and lo
 cal organizations\, and enjoy the lively energy of downtown Davis. Perfect
  for a relaxed Sunday outing with friends\, family\, or solo shopping. Bri
 ng reusable bags and comfy shoes!
URL:https://davisdowntown.com/event/day-in-downtown-2/
X-SOURCE:Davis Downtown
END:VEVENT
