BEGIN:VEVENT
X-SOURCE-URLS:{"Yolo Library": "https://events.yolocountylibrary.org/event/17270101"}
X-SOURCE-ID:yolo_library
SUMMARY:Author Talk: Market Memories Cookbook with Ann M. Evans & Georgean
 ne Brennan (Davis)
DTSTART;TZID=America/Los_Angeles:20261025T130000
DTEND;TZID=America/Los_Angeles:20261025T140000
UID:4bc82231e7f9cb276d13596320ff1cb4@events.yolocountylibrary.org
DESCRIPTION:The cookbook\, which has 92 recipes\, arranged by season\, als
 o tells the story of how the county’s iconic market evolved as the brain
 child of four young Davis people\, including co-author Ann M. Evans\, with
  a few farmers selling fruits and vegetables from the back of their pick-u
 ps\, to one of the most recognized farmers market in the United States. \n
 \nThe story is told through personal essays by the co-founders and others 
 with seminal involvement\, 32 anecdotal quotes from vendors\, shoppers\, a
 nd elected officials\, and a timeline chronicling market highlights over 5
 0 years\, as well as an in- memoriam page\, commemorating the market vendo
 rs who are deceased.\n\nThe book is illustrated by Ann and Georgeanne as w
 ell\, with beautiful pen and ink and watercolor washes for fruit and veget
 ables and flowers in all the seasons.
LOCATION:Blanchard Room\, Mary L Stephens Davis Branch Library
URL:https://events.yolocountylibrary.org/event/17270101
X-SOURCE:Yolo Library
END:VEVENT
BEGIN:VEVENT
X-SOURCE-URLS:{"Yolo Library": "https://events.yolocountylibrary.org/event/17073457"}
X-SOURCE-ID:yolo_library
SUMMARY:Tech Help (Davis)
DTSTART;TZID=America/Los_Angeles:20261025T130000
DTEND;TZID=America/Los_Angeles:20261025T150000
UID:f2f62a263c6f49c8bbb2854588bdfab3@events.yolocountylibrary.org
DESCRIPTION:Drop-in assistance with basic computer skills\, internet\, ema
 il\, eBooks (Libby). Bring your phone\, tablet\, eReader\, or laptop and a
