DESCRIPTION:Join GSP for a special event at the Mondavi Center.\nFor more 
 than 30 years\, Galactic has been a powerhouse of New Orleans music\, fusi
 ng funk\, jazz\, rock\, hip-hop and soul into a sound unmistakably their o
 wn. \nFrom late-night funk outfit to genre-defying collective\, Galactic b
 rings their electrifying live performance to Jackson Hall. Joined by power
 house vocalist Anjelika “Jelly” Joseph\, expect a night of fresh energ
 y\, soulful vocals\, and an expansive\, high-octane sound.\n\nTickets are 
 limited to 20 students. First come\, first served. A confirmation email wi
 ll be sent and you MUST confirm your attendance or you can lose your seat.
  \n\nTickets must be claimed by October 21st
LOCATION:Mondavi Center\, 523 Mrak Hall Dr\, Davis\, CA 95616\, United Sta
 tes
