SUMMARY:Workshop: Organize\, Cite\, Publish: Citation Management from Firs
 t Search to Final Draft
DTSTART;TZID=America/Los_Angeles:20261030T120000
DTEND;TZID=America/Los_Angeles:20261030T130000
UID:tag:localist.com\,2008:EventInstance_53949222829007
DESCRIPTION:Keep your sources\, notes\, PDFs\, and citations organized fro
 m your first search through your final draft. In this workshop\, we'll exp
 lore strategies for managing research throughout the literature review and
  publication process using citation management tools. Discover efficient w
 ays to import\, organize and tag sources\, annotate PDFs\, and generate ci
 tations and bibliographies. Come learn the tools and workflows that can sa
 ve you time—and make your thesis advisor a little envious.\n\n \n\nRegis
 ter:\n\nZoom Registration\n\nIn-Person Registration
LOCATION:Walker Hall\, Gibeling Room or Zoom
URL:https://events.library.ucdavis.edu/event/workshop-organize-cite-publis
 h-citation-management
X-SOURCE:UC Davis Library
END:VEVENT
