SUMMARY:Yolo County Library: Voice of the Wood\, Halloween Show
DESCRIPTION:Voice of the Wood is an educational performance group featuring artists Heidi Bekebrede and Dianna Craig who bring stories to life for children and families through sound effects\, dramatic narration\, and masked movement. Come experience their Halloween Show on Halloween! Location is the Mary L Stephens Davis Branch Library at 3:00 p.m. All ages are welcome.
