  and creates positive reading experiences. Kids are paired up with a UC D
 avis student reading mentor to read together\, build reading fluency\, and
  make reading fun.\n\nFor children Preschool to 5th grade.\n\nRegistration
  encouraged to help us pair readers with mentors. Drop-ins welcome. \n\nR
 eading Buddies is a collaboration with the UC Davis students from the Yout
 h Literacy Project.
