 t least 2 of the 3 GSP Program Requirements: https://aggielife.ucdavis.edu
 /guardianscholars/program-requirements/. \n\nIt is important that students
  complete the requirements on a quarterly basis to continue to be consider
 ed for these opportunities. \n\nIf you are not among the first 10 students
