 cal farmers and vendors offering: \n🥕 Fresh\, seasonal produce🌻 Farm
  products🛍 Handmade crafts🥖 Fresh-baked goods☕ Coffee and hot food
  \nWhether you’re stocking up on locally grown ingredients\, enjoying br
 eakfast in the park\, or simply soaking in the vibrant community atmospher
 e\, the Davis Farmers Market is a beloved weekly tradition for all ages. \
 nBring your family\, support local growers and makers\, and enjoy the boun
 ty of our fertile region every Saturday!
